    "Guarded SIP media/controller, actual SIP private duplex readiness, successful SIP endpoint confirmation/movement, independent established phone lifetime and public Connect callback/Store projection remain unimplemented. Canonical runtime still refuses non-QUIC replacement before reservation.",
    "Actual SIP INFO fixture uses explicitly configured single digit 5. Complete multi-digit confirmation assembly across attributed singleton callbacks, deduplication/replay and readiness/epoch changes remains required; controlled composite-digit adapter fixtures do not qualify that wire behavior.",
    "Independent current production target credential/route authority at each phone effect, durable pre-submission attempt/receipt recording and complete no-answer/voicemail/rejected-confirmation/timeout/cancel/late-old-event/unknown-submission/restart recovery remain required.",
    "Durable replay of retargeted selectors/private contexts under later churn remains required.",
    "Full Store/Core/all-workspace and Linux/browser/remote/provider/performance profiles, independent acceptance and publication were not qualified by this component."
